      "id": "applet-for-web-ui",
      "requirement": "Keep the `applet` tool in the base registry for every client. Upstream 73114dcf6 gates it behind the Desktop user_response capability, but Amiro's web UI renders inline applets (Visualize skill, backend system prompt) while the backend reports supports_user_response=false. Only user_response follows the Desktop capability.",
      "sentinels": [
        {
          "path": "runtime/crates/amiro-app-core/src/tool/mod.rs",
          "contains": [
