      "requirement": "Load the agent-home persona files from the session's team-agent folder when its working directory is inside $AMIRO_AGENTS_ROOT (set by the backend to ~/.amiro/agents), else from $AMIRO_AGENT_HOME. Folders outside the root never replace the persona. See docs/multi-agent-team/02-design.md.",
